<title>USA: R.P. Scherer Corp Q4 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>R.P. Scherer Corp Q4 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	 $0.68		    $0.61</p>
<p> Oper net		  29,046		   24,994</p>
<p> Revs		     150,074		  152,239</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter 1996 excludes restructuring charges. Including those charges, the company had a net loss of $4.6 million, or $0.19 a share.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $2.31		    $2.04</p>
<p> Oper net		 104,320		  100,750</p>
<p> Revs		     588,699		  571,710</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 12 months 1996 excluding restructuring and other items. Including the items, 12 months 1996 oper income was $66.9 million, or $1.25 a share.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
